   "text": "INTO London World Education Centre - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nINTO London World Education Centre\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nINTO London offers a guaranteed pathway to one of 100+ universities across the UK and Europe. Our tailored preparation programs are designed to suit each student's individual needs, with expert support to help them achieve their full potential.There are thousands of degrees to choose from, and INTO London students have been offered places at a wide range of universities – including those in the Russell Group and the global top 100.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 09:41\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 09:41\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £33,750.00\nMin: £24,260.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n300%\n3,000 of 1,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nINTO\nFounded Year\n2013\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/01/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAs accommodation is allocated on a first-come, first-served basis, students should confirm their place soon after receiving an offer to have the best chance of getting their preferred option.\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MIlxflWAeSU\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
